id":"0Uur"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c6794aa-41e3-4bff-956d-b7c3eaa527c3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たとえばプライベートはこれして対応してる\n```[url \"git@github.com:tsuyoshicho/\"]\n\tpushInsteadOf = \u003chttps://github.com/tsuyoshicho/\u003e\n\tpushInsteadOf = \u003cgit://github.com/tsuyoshicho/\u003e\n\tpushInsteadOf = \u003chttps://tsuyoshicho@github.com/tsuyoshicho/\u003e\n\tpushInsteadOf = \u003cgit://tsuyoshicho@github.com/tsuyoshicho/\u003e```","ts":"1625877458.001700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M2A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91af7c6b-b744-4578-94e3-98dafacb5bc5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"デフォルトを HTTPS にしておきたいのはなんででしょう?","ts":"1625877396.001100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7qTuN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38c5ec6a-4419-46fa-b632-34566bb4bfc8","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"こんな感じです","ts":"1625877233.000600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NO1ey"}]},{"client_msg_id":"683ba03f-ad6c-4f72-9de4-b079596a01e9","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"• デフォルトはHTTPSにしておきたい\n• HTTPSだとプライベートリポジトリなどはユーザー名を求められるので面倒\n• プライベート・OrganizationのみSSHでcloneしたい","ts":"1625877225.000300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RDm="}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c92e9e9-b39f-4eb0-8184-04b7afc7e276","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"gitのinsteadOfをOrganizationのみに適応するとかできないですかね?","ts":"1625877114.498400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hnKJc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e90913cf-6d8f-4998-9e8b-705d59f0ccea","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"おお、またまたありがとございます。xargsのことよくわかってませんでした","ts":"1625873472.497400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"skaO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68038bdd-1a0e-4058-92c3-abdb814d76e5","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"local $GH は不要じゃないでしょうか。\nxargs は実コマンドしか呼べないわけですし。\n```command gh \"$subcommand\" list \"$@\" \\\n    | fzf --preview \"echo {} | sed -E 's/\\s.*//' | xargs gh $subcommand view\" \\\n    | sed -E 's/\\s.*//'  \\\n    | xargs gh $subcommand view --web```","ts":"1625852327.496500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CgD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55ffda0d-4536-4c2b-be3a-a9bec28dfec2","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ですね。なんかどっちつかずになってました(笑)","ts":"1625852032.495100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7ku"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24b21edb-ba21-4480-b5ad-afd23f83b596","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"よくみたらすでに↑のスクリプトでちゃんと使われてますね `gh` がかぶってるから","ts":"1625852009.494500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AMO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3e282f9-6270-409a-b561-0496a870df01","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"なるほどです！ありがとうございます","ts":"1625852005.494300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FNF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ec6f2d3-09ad-4dee-8f3b-eb61fa5b0a0a","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"vim で noremap 使うくらいの気分で使っていいんじゃないですかね","ts":"1625851980.493700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mYeUV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb7676aa-9c09-42bd-a6f6-ee70c1443c6f","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"あ、たしかに。ありがとうございます。こういうのって徹底的にcommand fooってしちゃうのが安全でいいんですかね……？","ts":"1625851950.493300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kBzr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92a54579-351f-45e7-8